# proto-file: flatsat/hardware/devices.proto
# proto-message: flatsat.v1.StarTrackerDevice
#
# Quaternion-level star tracker, ST-16 class numbers: arcsecond-family
# cross-boresight accuracy, the usual 6-7x worse roll. Boresight looks
# out along -z: with the vehicle nadir-pointing (+z at Earth) the Earth
# NEVER enters the field of view, and the sun sweeps past once per
# orbit — the exclusion cone makes those passes honest blackouts.

name: "st0"
rate_hz: 5.0
cross_noise_rad: 0.00003    # ~6 arcsec, 1-sigma
roll_noise_rad: 0.0002      # ~40 arcsec, 1-sigma
boresight: [0.0, 0.0, -1.0]
sun_exclusion_deg: 30.0
earth_exclusion_deg: 25.0
